# ─── Nested git repos — each has its own remote/history, tracked separately ──
# (git add -A would otherwise stage them as broken dangling gitlinks: no
# .gitmodules exists, so a plain commit here would not actually capture their
# contents). agentic-ollama-platform: github.com/PraveenAsthana123/autoollamasetup.
# integrations/paperclip: vendored third-party, github.com/paperclipai/paperclip.
/agentic-ollama-platform/
/integrations/paperclip/
/vendor/skyvern/

